# gpui-component 0.7.0 — the component surface Tailor catalogues against.
#
# Regenerate with `cargo run -p tailor-surface -- gpuikit`, which fetches the
# version pinned in the tool. Do that in the same commit as a version bump:
# the `version` line below is checked against what the provider asks for,
# so a stale file fails the tests rather than going unnoticed.
#
# component <Type> <file>            a RenderOnce builder or a Render entity
# preset    <id> <constructor> <scheme>

